detail.description:
Inventory every W114/Hodge attempt and assign one evidence class:
FORMAL/EXACT, EXHAUSTIVE_FINITE, TESTED, STRUCTURAL_REDUCTION, NEGATIVE_FAMILY_RESULT, HEURISTIC, SUPERSEDED_CORRECTION, OPEN.

Include:

* character/partition screens;
* Shioda/Aoki reductions;
* p=229 order-114 Jacobi calculation;
* corrected sign 3(7-zeta_3) and p=571 counterprobe;
* matrix-factorization/Koszul screens;
* 114->57 deck/double-cover route;
* projector/join/motivic composition;
* 4D/K5/visual analogies;
* failed and corrected software receipts.

Acceptance: every item has scope, dependency, counterprobe, and explicit “does not imply” boundary.
